    "body": "# Keyboard shortcuts\n\nOn macOS use ⌘ where this page says Ctrl.\n\n## Tools\n\n| Key | Tool |\n| --- | --- |\n| V | Select |\n| H | Hand (pan) |\n| P | Pen |\n| E | Eraser |\n| N | Sticky note |\n| T | Text |\n| R | Rectangle |\n| O | Ellipse |\n| D | Diamond |\n| A | Arrow |\n| I | Image |\n\n## Actions\n\n| Shortcut | Action |\n| --- | --- |\n| Ctrl+Z | Undo |\n| Ctrl+Shift+Z | Redo |\n| Ctrl+D | Duplicate selection |\n| Delete / Backspace | Delete selection |\n| Ctrl+S | Save a named version |\n| Ctrl+K | Command search |\n| Ctrl+/ | Toggle the diagram code panel |\n| Ctrl+0 | Reset zoom |\n| Ctrl + scroll | Zoom |\n| Space + drag | Pan |\n"
